<h1 class="text-3xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-brandBlue uppercase italic tracking-tighter mb-4 leading-tight">Anker Alternatives for OEM Buyers: MOQ 500 to Full OEM</h1>
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
<img src="/image/factory/team-nina.webp" alt="Nina Nico, Global Procurement & Sourcing Manager at WOWOHCOOL" loading="lazy" width="800" height="800" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full object-cover border border-brandOrange" decoding="async">
