<section id="top-7-product-categories-to-source" class="mb-16">
<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
<div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-brandBlue uppercase italic mb-6">4. Top 7 Product Categories to Source</h2>
<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">The <a href="/products/">product categories</a> below are ordered by the demand we see in OEM inquiries and by factory readiness. FOB ranges are for 500 units and reflect Grade-A cells where applicable plus standard certification documentation. Your quote will move with cell grade, port count and packaging.</p>
<div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl mb-6"><table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse border border-slate-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden"><thead><tr class="bg-brandBlue text-white text-badge font-black uppercase tracking-widest"><th class="p-4 text-left">#</th><th class="p-4 text-left">Category</th><th class="p-4 text-left">Benchmark spec to quote</th><th class="p-4 text-left">FOB at 500 units</th><th class="p-4 text-left">Why it is a gap</th></tr></thead><tbody class="text-slate-600"><tr class="border-b border-slate-100"><td class="p-4">1</td><td class="p-4">65W multi-port GaN charger</td><td class="p-4">2C1A, PD 3.0/PPS, foldable plug</td><td class="p-4">$6.00–8.50</td><td class="p-4">Highest-volume premium replacement</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-slate-100"><td class="p-4">2</td><td class="p-4">Qi2 magnetic power bank</td><td class="p-4">10,000mAh, 15W MPP, N52H magnets</td><td class="p-4">$8.70–12.00 (derived)</td><td class="p-4">iPhone accessory demand with certification moat</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-slate-100"><td class="p-4">3</td><td class="p-4">140W PD 3.1 charger</td><td class="p-4">3C1A, EPR, thermal derating data</td><td class="p-4">$18.00–24.00</td><td class="p-4">Laptop-first buyers, fewer credible factories</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-slate-100"><td class="p-4">4</td><td class="p-4">20,000mAh 65W power bank</td><td class="p-4">65W USB-C, digital display</td><td class="p-4">$12.00–16.00</td><td class="p-4">Travel and remote-work segment</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-slate-100"><td class="p-4">5</td><td class="p-4">Semi-solid-state power bank</td><td class="p-4">10,000mAh, thinner cell, thermal data</td><td class="p-4">$14.00–18.00</td><td class="p-4">Differentiation instead of price matching</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-slate-100"><td class="p-4">6</td><td class="p-4">2-in-1 hybrid charger</td><td class="p-4">Wall charger plus power bank, 45W</td><td class="p-4">$10.00–14.00</td><td class="p-4">One-device travel positioning</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-slate-100"><td class="p-4">7</td><td class="p-4">65W GaN car charger</td><td class="p-4">Dual port, 12V/24V, low-profile body</td><td class="p-4">$7.00–9.00</td><td class="p-4">Fleet and rideshare channels</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">The Qi2 row is derived, not a standalone quote: 10,000mAh PD 20W platform ($7.50–10.00) plus the Qi2 certification adder ($1.20–2.00 per unit).</p>
<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">The volume leaders are the 65W GaN charger, the 20,000mAh 65W power bank and the 65W car charger. The differentiation plays are Qi2, 140W PD 3.1 and semi-solid-state. The 2-in-1 hybrid is a niche bet on one-device travel.</p>
<h3 class="text-lg font-black text-brandBlue mt-6 mb-3">4.1 Qi2 magnetic power bank: verify certification, not compatibility</h3>
<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Qi2 uses the Magnetic Power Profile (MPP) and requires WPC certification plus an authorized authentication IC. That requirement filters out many low-cost suppliers. If a quote is far below the range, verify whether the product is Qi2-certified or only "Qi2-compatible."</p>
<h3 class="text-lg font-black text-brandBlue mt-6 mb-3">4.2 140W PD 3.1 charger: demand thermal data</h3>
<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">PD 3.1 Extended Power Range is the laptop-first tier. Fewer factories can hold 140W across multiple ports without throttling. Request a 30-minute load test at 25°C and 35°C.</p>
<h3 class="text-lg font-black text-brandBlue mt-6 mb-3">4.3 Semi-solid-state power bank: ask for cycle life</h3>
<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">This category lets you compete on form factor and safety narrative instead of price. The buyer question is not "is it solid-state?" It is "what is the cycle life, and can you show the test report?"</p>
<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Product lines for each category sit under our <a href="/products/power-bank/">OEM power banks</a> and <a href="/products/wireless-charger/">Qi2 wireless charger OEM</a> pages.</p>
<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">For the Qi2 magnetic family, the <a href="/products/power-bank/wireless-magnetic/">Qi2 magnetic power bank line</a> covers magnet grades, certification and enclosure options.</p>
